  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Casa Ecologie Fruit Juice Processing and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fruit processing.Beneficiaries: 238 (81 women).Description: Casa Ecologie is in the processing of increasing its production so that it can satisfy its growing customer base. After two years of operations with the current, OAG-funded equipment, they have grown continuously. Although production is increasing every year, they are limited by the capacity of the current processing equipment, and by the lack of a cooling capacity for raw material. The project will increase production capacity, as well as necessary storage capacity to ensure year round rather than seasonal production. Additional working capital will enable the group to obtain sufficient quantities of raw material to counter its seasonality.</narrative>
  </description>
